From: seeker <gmx472@qq.com>
Subject: [PATCH] thermal: qcom: fix IPQ5018 units and sensor lifecycle

Use milliCelsius for the thermal ABI and scale the matching DT thresholds
and hysteresis. Convert trip writes to the calibrated ADC representation,
propagate register errors and preserve thresholds when acknowledging alarms.
Force acknowledgement writes even when the readback value is unchanged.

Allow cold-start initialization before TSENS is enabled. Publish calibration
before admitting IRQ work, propagate deferred probing and invalid samples,
and quiesce IRQs and work before managed resources are released. Retrieve
PM state from driver data and manage the added hwmon groups with devres.

--- a/drivers/thermal/qcom/tsens-common.c
+++ b/drivers/thermal/qcom/tsens-common.c
